"setup.parent.title" = "Manage your child’s screen time";
"setup.parent.body" = "Set a daily limit, schedules and tasks with minute rewards. Check remaining time and request your child’s location.\n\nYour phone only needs notification permission. Other permissions are set up on your child’s phone.";
"setup.child.title" = "Set up your child’s phone";
"setup.child.body" = "Complete these steps with a parent. Permissions let the app track time in selected apps, apply restrictions and share the child’s location with their parent.\n\nCamera access is requested only when taking a task photo. Health access isn’t needed.";
"setup.screen_time.body" = "Allow Screen Time access to track selected apps and block them when the limit is reached, during schedules or at the parent’s request.\n\nRestrictions won’t work without this permission.";
"setup.notifications.child.body" = "Allow notifications so your child can see changes to available time, blocking updates and task messages.\n\nWith notifications off, important messages may be missed.";
"setup.location.body" = "To let the parent see their child’s location, allow location access: first While Using the App, then Always.\n\nLocation is checked only at the parent’s request. Always access is needed for background requests.";
"setup.pairing.title" = "Connect the two phones";
"setup.parent.pairing_body" = "On your phone, open Settings → Connection to child and create a pairing code.\n\nInstall this same app on your child’s phone and choose Child phone. After setup, enter the code on its home screen.";
"setup.protection.body" = "To prevent your child from deleting the app, their child account must belong to an Apple Family Sharing group.\n\nAfter pairing, the parent can enable protection on the child’s phone: Parent → PIN → Settings → Removal protection.\n\nThe app also works without this protection, but the child can delete it.";
"setup.finish.title" = "Next steps";
"setup.parent.finish_body" = "After pairing the phones, set a parent PIN in Settings. It protects the settings on your child’s phone.\n\nSet a daily limit on the home screen. It applies only to apps selected on your child’s phone.";
"setup.child.finish_body" = "On the home screen, enter the pairing code from the parent’s phone.\n\nAfter pairing, the parent should set a PIN on their own phone. Then, on this phone: Parent → PIN → Block List — choose the apps to manage.\n\nThe daily limit is set on the parent’s phone.";
